<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Shoredits' JSE share suspension lifted.</title>
<headline>Shoredits' JSE share suspension lifted.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction company Shoredits Ltd announced on Monday that its listing had been reinstated on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange (JSE) following an audit of its results.</p>
<p>On Friday, the JSE suspended the company's shares after the exchange had been advised that Shoredit's results had not been audited.</p>
<p>Shoredits said in a statement on Monday that it had inadvertently published audited results prior to completion of the audit.</p>
<p>&quot;The audit has since been completed without change to the published results,&quot; it said.  </p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
